1
00:00:00,939 --> 00:00:04,429
(Raj:)Really? Then what were you doing
at the comic book store that night?

2
00:00:05,544 --> 00:00:09,104
(Girl:)I've been trying to force myself
into situations I'm not comfortable with.

3
00:00:09,915 --> 00:00:14,045
(Girl:)I saw the flyer in the store window
and I made myself go in.

4
00:00:14,219 --> 00:00:15,949
(Girl:)I don't even like comic books.

5
00:00:16,121 --> 00:00:18,381
- Yeah, me neither.
- What were you doing there?

6
00:00:18,557 --> 00:00:20,217
(Raj:)I lied. I love them.

7
00:00:22,594 --> 00:00:25,124
(Raj:)I only said that so you'd go out with me.

8
00:00:25,330 --> 00:00:26,800
(Girl:)You don't want to do that.

9
00:00:26,965 --> 00:00:28,395
(Girl:)I'm kind of broken.

10
00:00:28,567 --> 00:00:30,767
(Raj:)That's great. I'm broken too.

11
00:00:30,936 --> 00:00:32,906
(Girl:)- No, you're not.
- I totally am.

12
00:00:33,072 --> 00:00:36,902
(Raj:)If it wasn't for this beer, I couldn't even
talk to you right now. I'm a wreck.

13
00:00:37,076 --> 00:00:39,906
(Raj:)There are many things
seriously wrong with me.

14
00:00:41,447 --> 00:00:43,577
(Raj:)And not quirks either...

15
00:00:43,749 --> 00:00:47,449
(Raj:)...like, diagnosable psychological problems.

16
00:00:49,588 --> 00:00:51,418
(Raj:)Maybe brain damage.

17
00:00:53,892 --> 00:00:58,022
(Girl:)Well, how do I know
you're not just saying that?

